n":"ch0280_battle_recovery_1","category":"battle","text":"谢谢你！","text_original":"ありがとよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_battle_recovery_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_battle_retire","category":"battle","text":"切！","text_original":"ちっ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_battle_retire.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_battle_shout_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_battle_shout_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_battle_shout_2","category":"battle","text":"接招！","text_original":"くらえ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_battle_shout_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_battle_shout_3","category":"battle","text":"干啊！","text_original":"ドリャ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_battle_shout_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_battle_tacticalaction_1","category":"battle","text":"哈！","text_original":"はっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_battle_tacticalaction_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_battle_victory_1","category":"battle","text":"只有这点程度啊……","text_original":"こんなもんかよ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_battle_victory_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_battle_victory_2","category":"battle","text":"对方好像没发现是我啊。","text_original":"相手があたしだって気づかなかったのかよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_battle_victory_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"（那是什么？好酷啊！）","text_original":"（なんだあれ？カッケェ！）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"嗯，倒也不坏。休息一下吧。","text_original":"まあ、悪くねぇな。ちっと一休みするか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"总感觉冷静不下来……是不是因为没有外套？","text_original":"なんか落ち着かねえんだよな……上着がないからか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"老师什么时候来……？","text_original":"先生はいつ来るんだ……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"哦，这个不错啊！我都想在部室里装饰一个了。","text_original":"お、これいいな！部室に飾りたいくらいだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"哦，感觉好厉害啊？","text_original":"お、なんかすごいな？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_eventlobby_1","category":"event","text":"怎么了？有事的话就赶紧说吧。","text_original":"なんだ？用事があるならさっさと言ってくれ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_eventlobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_eventlobby_2","category":"event","text":"啊？只是戳戳看而已，什么意思啊？","text_original":"はぁ？つついてみただけ？なんだそりゃ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_eventlobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_eventlobby_3","category":"event","text":"......唉，做那种像小孩一样的事。","text_original":"……はぁ、ガキみてぇなことしやがって。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_eventlobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_eventlobby_4","category":"event","text":"哈哈！下次就轮到我哦。做好觉悟吧。","text_original":"ははっ！次はあたしの番だからな。覚悟しとけよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_eventlobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_eventlogin_1","category":"event","text":"呦~老师！这边，这边！","text_original":"よお、先生！こっち、こっち！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_eventlogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_eventlogin_2","category":"event","text":"啊，这不是老师吗！你迟到了！","text_original":"あ、先生じゃん！遅いぞ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_eventlogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_eventlogin_season_1","category":"event","text":"好了，打起精神来吧。","text_original":"ほら、気をしっかり持ってくれ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_eventlogin_season_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_eventlogin_season_2","category":"event","text":"就剩一点了不是吗？结束之后会陪你玩的，再忍耐一下吧。","text_original":"あとちょっとだろ？終わったら遊んでやるから、ちったあ我慢しな！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_eventlogin_season_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_eventlogin_season_end","category":"event","text":"哈~真开心，老师你呢？","text_original":"はぁー！楽しかった！先生はどうだった？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_eventlogin_season_end.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_exskill_1_1","category":"battle","text":"唉，真麻烦。喂，待在那里别动哦？","text_original":"はあ、面倒くせえな。おい、そこ動くなよ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_exskill_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_exskill_1_2","category":"battle","text":"你们这些家伙，给我咬紧牙关啊。","text_original":"てめぇら、歯ァ食いしばってろよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_exskill_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_exskill_1_3","category":"battle","text":"恶意？当然有啦！","text_original":"悪気……？あるに決まってんだろ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_exskill_1_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_exskill_2_1","category":"battle","text":"差不多该做个了解了吧？","text_original":"そろそろケリつけようぜ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_exskill_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_exskill_2_2","category":"battle","text":"这样啊！那么，现在轮到我了！","text_original":"そうかよ！んじゃ、こっちの番だな！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_exskill_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_exskill_2_3","category":"battle","text":"没用没用。","text_original":"無駄、無駄ァ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_exskill_2_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_exskill_level_1_1","category":"battle","text":"就会给我添麻烦！","text_original":"手間かけさせやがって！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_exskill_level_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_exskill_level_1_2","category":"battle","text":"马上就了解你们。","text_original":"すぐに終わらせてやる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_exskill_level_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_exskill_level_1_3","category":"battle","text":"这样就结束了。","text_original":"これで終わりだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_exskill_level_1_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_exskill_level_2_1","category":"battle","text":"看招看招ー！","text_original":"おらおらぁー！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_exskill_level_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_exskill_level_2_2","category":"battle","text":"哈哈！！","text_original":"ははっ！！！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_exskill_level_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_exskill_level_2_3","category":"battle","text":"没用的！","text_original":"無駄なんだよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_exskill_level_2_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"仔细想想好像和平时没什么不一样的…但总有种特殊的感觉啊…嘛，毕竟是我和老师的交情，没什么好在意的吧！","text_original":"考えてみたら全然普段と変わんねぇんだけど……なーんか、特別に感じるんだよな。……ま、あたしと先生の仲だし、気にしてもしょうがないか！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"真没办法。","text_original":"しゃあねえな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"啊？又有工作吗？","text_original":"あ？また仕事か？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"唉…没穿外衣，总感觉心情有点微妙。","text_original":"はあ……上着がねぇと、なんかビミョーなんだよな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_formation_select.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"千禧科学学院的美甘妮禄，登场！啊？这身衣服？有什么奇怪的吗？","text_original":"ミレニアムサイエンススクールの美甘ネル、ただいま参上したぜ、っと……。あぁ？この服？なにかおかしいっていうのか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"感觉不错嘛，谢啦！","text_original":"悪い気はしねぇな！サンキュ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"诶？啊啊，那个…多谢了…","text_original":"え？ああまぁ、その……ありがとな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"怎么说呢，感觉就像真正的学生和老师一样啊……啊不，这是事实啊。","text_original":"なんつーか、本当の生徒と先生みたいだよな。……いや、合ってるか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"非常感谢！老师！这样如何，会不会很奇怪！","text_original":"ありがとうございます！先生！……ってのはどうだ？変か？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_lobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"总觉得心里痒痒的……是跟平时不一样的原因吧？","text_original":"なーんか、ムズムズするんだよな……普段と違うからだろうけどさ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_lobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_lobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"唉…真怀念我帅气的外套啊。","text_original":"はぁ……上着が恋しいぜ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_lobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊？穿着制服变得比较老实了？","text_original":"あぁ？制服を着て大人しくなった？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_lobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_lobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"怎么可能！只是今天稍微有点没精神而已。","text_original":"んなわけあるか！今日はちょっと元気がないだけだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_lobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"什么…制服很适合我...！？就，就算称赞我也没有好处的哦！","text_original":"なっ……制服、よく似合ってるね……！？ほ、褒めても何も出ねぇぞ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_lobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"老师，你有擅长的科目吗？…不是…怎么说呢？只是难得穿上了制服，想说要不要学习一会而已。","text_original":"先生、得意な教科はあるか？いや……なんだ？せっかく制服着てることだし、勉強でもしようかと。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_lobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"现在最能放心的地方…不就是在这里吗？","text_original":"今一番落ち着ける場所……ここじゃねぇか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_lobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"呦，老师！啊！我，我可没在等你啊！？","text_original":"よ、先生！あぁ？べ、別に待ってたわけじゃねぇぞ！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"干嘛无精打采的啊，我不是在这陪着你嘛！","text_original":"何しょぼくれてんだよ。あたしがそばに居るだろ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"哦！快看啊老师！这上面有好多种料！","text_original":"お！見ろよ先生！色んなもんがあるぞ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯？怎么了吗？","text_original":"ん？どうかしたのか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊~嘛…那可不。","text_original":"あ～、まぁ……そりゃあな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"毕竟今天不是C&C，而且我和老师有不是前后辈的关系对吧？","text_original":"今はC＆Cでもないし、先生とは先輩後輩の関係でもないだろ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"这里也没什么认识的人。","text_original":"ここに知り合いなんていねぇしさ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"至少现在就别在意那么多了嘛。","text_original":"今くらい、許してくれよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"还是说，果然…","text_original":"というか、やっぱ……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_memoriallobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"像平时那样更好吗？","text_original":"普段みたいな方がいいか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_memoriallobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"哈哈，我就知道您会这么说！","text_original":"ははっ！そう言うと思った！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_memoriallobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"嘛，时间也不是那么充裕......","text_original":"まあ、そんなに時間に余裕があるわけじゃねえし……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_memoriallobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_memoriallobby_5_3","category":"lobby","text":"差不多出发吧，接下来要去那里!","text_original":"そろそろ行こうぜ！次はあっちだ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_memoriallobby_5_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"不管穿什么衣服，我就是我。老师也像平时那样对待我就行了。","text_original":"どんな格好だろうとあたしはあたしだ。先生もいつも通りに接してくれよな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"嗯……该说是心里暖暖的呢，还是痒痒的呢……不，我并不讨厌这种感觉啦！","text_original":"うーん、なんか胸がポカポカするっていうか、むずむずするっていうか……いや、別にイヤじゃねぇんだけど。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"总，总觉得比平时还要羞耻……可恶啊!这种感觉到底是啥啊！","text_original":"な、なんかいつもより恥ずかしい気が……クソッ！なんだよこれ！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"可以的话要一起去散步吗？我来带路。","text_original":"よかったら散歩でも行かねえか？案内するぜ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"哈哈，您果然记得啊！多谢啦！","text_original":"ははっ！やっぱ覚えててくれたのか！ありがとな！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_season_birthday.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"今天是老师的生日对吧？生日快乐！机会难得，一起出去玩呗？","text_original":"今日は先生の誕生日だろ？誕生日おめでとさん！せっかくだし、遊びに行かねぇか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_season_birthday_player.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"其他人每天都穿着制服，但对我来说这身制服就像是化装一样。","text_original":"他の連中は毎日制服きてるけどあたしにとっては仮装みたいなもんなんだよな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_season_halloween.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_season_newyear_1","category":"lobby","text":"新年快乐，老师！今年也请多关照咯！啊？您问我为什么穿着制服？","text_original":"明けましておめでとう、先生。今年もよろしくな。ん？なんで制服なのかって？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_season_newyear_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_season_newyear_2","category":"lobby","text":"那是因为…老师说过制服很适合我…我就想着今天穿上也没问题…之类的。","text_original":"そりゃあ……先生が似合うって言ってくれたし……今日くらいは着てもいいかなって。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_season_newyear_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞节吗…啊，对了。我把我的外套作为礼物送给您如何呀？反正您现在也没穿，披上看看嘛！","text_original":"クリスマスか……あ、そうだ。プレゼントにあたしの上着はどうだ？今着てないし、羽織ってみろよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_season_xmas.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_tactic_defeat_1","category":"battle","text":"呼…忍耐，忍耐…！","text_original":"へ...我慢だ、我慢...！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_tactic_defeat_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_tactic_defeat_2","category":"battle","text":"真让人生气！","text_original":"イライラさせやがって！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_tactic_defeat_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_tactic_in_1","category":"battle","text":"给人带路也不轻松啊。","text_original":"案内すんのも楽じゃねえな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_tactic_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_tactic_in_2","category":"battle","text":"是不是有点太多了？","text_original":"ちっと多すぎねぇか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_tactic_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_tactic_victory_1","category":"battle","text":"好，清干净了。","text_original":"よし、キレイになったな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_tactic_victory_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_tactic_victory_2","category":"battle","text":"如果还缺少什么的话就说吧，我一口气帮你解决。","text_original":"足りないとこがあるなら言いな。一気に終わらせてやるよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0280_tactic_victory_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0280_Title","category":"lobby","text":"蔚蓝档案！","text_original":"ブルーアーカイブ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/CH0280_Title.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[],"voice_kr":[{"description":"ch0280_battle_buffed_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E5%88%B6%E6%9C%8D/kr/ch0280_battle_buffed_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_battle_buffself_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E5%88%B6%E6%9C%8D/kr/ch0280_battle_buffself_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_battle_covered_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E5%88%B6%E6%9C%8D/kr/ch0280_battle_covered_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_battle_damage_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E5%88%B6%E6%9C%8D/kr/ch0280_battle_damage_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_battle_damage_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E5%88%B6%E6%9C%8D/kr/ch0280_battle_damage_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280_battle_damage_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/%E5%88%B6%E6%9C%8D/kr/ch0280_battle_damage_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0280